{"overview":"پس از فاجعه‌ای ویرانگر که جهان را زیرورو می‌کند، دختری جوان از قوم خاک‌افزار درمی‌یابد که پس از کورا، آواتار جدید است. او که اکنون نشانه‌ای از وقوع فاجعه‌ای شوم تلقی می‌شود، به همراه خواهر یا برادر دوقلویش برای نجات هفت پناهگاه به رقابتی نفس‌گیر با زمان قدم می‌گذارد؛ در حالی که هم انسان‌ها و هم اروا ...","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a world shattered by a devastating cataclysm, a young Earthbender discovers she's the new Avatar after Korra. But in this dangerous era, that title marks her as humanity's destroyer, not its savior. Hunted by both human and spirit enemies, she and her long-lost twin must uncover their mysterious origins and save the Seven Havens before civilization's last strongholds collapse.","tagline_en":"New legends will rise.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/vZYNw9VAA7VSzomlvoc3L60w1Rd.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":["مایکل دانته دی‌مارتینو","برایان کونیتزکو"],"crew_en":["Michael Dante DiMartino","Bryan Konietzko"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Saheli Khan","role":"Pavi (voice)","photo":"/v7KEBCh275MWmT0j5fxm4fslosD.jpg"},{"name":"Aishwarya 'Aishu' Devan","role":"Nisha (voice)","photo":"/eRDnTa8yKo0G79j7Z48jeNODRuj.jpg"},{"name":"Major Curda","role":"Jae (voice)","photo":"/oHkyajLazp64ttgStLcJTY4wTvU.jpg"},{"name":"Akshay Khanna","role":"Karthik (voice)","photo":"/L2JWyOTwPRLHBLV7xUmDOcRHU3.jpg"},{"name":"سکینه جعفری","role":"Agam (voice)","photo":"/9U6vixMcwkj8aEffy64UqsklHd.jpg","en":"Sakina Jaffrey"}],"trailer":"nhdh962_ee0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284833-avatar-seven-havens/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Paramount Plus Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/4N4BMd0Mm0kHAmF7RZgL5lW3cwc.png"},{"n":"Paramount Plus Essential","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uPWQPyF4nqwtfPNmGcFcenU57HG.png"},{"n":"Paramount Plus Apple TV channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/xu4LyKTwasTbta1Z0qWtZG48yZ3.png"},{"n":"Paramount+ Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","log